// Reviewed operation guidance; not diagnosis or automatic actions.
"第一次如何拍攝？" = "How do I take the first photo?";
"量測 → 拍攝傷口" = "Measure → Photograph wound";
"使用有 LiDAR 的後相機，把一處目標放在中央，約 25–40 公分、盡量正對。等對焦框變綠再拍。這次外測請使用紙上圖形或模擬模型。" = "Use a rear camera with LiDAR. Center one target, approximately 25–40 cm away and as straight on as possible. Wait for the focus frame to turn green before taking the photo. For this beta test, use a paper target or a simulated model.";
"為什麼這筆沒有面積？" = "Why is there no area for this record?";
"設定 → 精確度與限制" = "Settings → Accuracy and limitations";
"確認相機有 LiDAR，畫面清楚，圈選貼合目標。若畫面提示深度或品質不足，依當筆提示調整角度或距離。報告會保留沒有可靠面積的那次紀錄。" = "Check that the camera has LiDAR, the image is clear and the outline fits the target. If depth or quality is insufficient, follow the message for that capture to adjust the angle or distance. The report retains records that have no reliable area.";
"怎麼修正已存的圈選？" = "How do I edit a saved outline?";
"紀錄 → 選取一筆 → 修正圈選並更新紀錄" = "Records → Select a record → Edit outline and update record";
"開啟原紀錄，改動邊界後完成，核對面積和保存訊息。沒有修改可直接返回。若曾送研究資料，請分別查看本機保存與雲端確認狀態。" = "Open the original record, edit the boundary and finish. Check the area and save message. If you make no changes, return directly. If research data was submitted, check local saving and cloud confirmation separately.";
"如何看同一處傷口前後兩張照片？" = "How do I compare two photos of the same wound?";
"紀錄 → 選一處傷口 → 比較最近兩次照片" = "Records → Select a wound → Compare the two latest photos";
"日期可核對的最近兩次拍攝會各自標出。畫面較窄時上下排列。拍攝角度、距離及光線會影響外觀，缺少的照片會標明。" = "The two latest captures with verifiable dates are labeled separately. On a narrow screen they appear one above the other. Angle, distance and lighting affect appearance. Missing photos are clearly marked.";
"如何帶一份報告去看診？" = "How do I share a report at an appointment?";
"紀錄 → 選一處傷口 → 匯出此傷口時間軸 PDF" = "Records → Select a wound → Export this wound timeline as PDF";
"選擇全部日期或指定期間，決定是否附上照片與圈選，再按「產生並分享 PDF」。先預覽日期、面積來源及收件對象。本機匯出不需重新辨識。" = "Choose all dates or a date range, decide whether to include photos and outlines, then select “Create and share PDF”. Preview the dates, area sources and recipient before sharing. Local export does not require another recognition.";
"結束追蹤後還能看舊紀錄嗎？" = "Can I view old records after ending tracking?";
"紀錄 → 管理追蹤" = "Records → Manage tracking";
"免費可同時追蹤 1 處，Plus 每帳戶最多 5 處。在另一台裝置調整後，可重新核對名額。結束追蹤可空出名額，原時間軸及 PDF 仍可查看。" = "Free accounts can track 1 wound at a time; Plus allows up to 5 per account. After changes on another device, verify the available slots again. Ending tracking frees a slot. The original timeline and PDF remain available.";
"使用本機免費名額可追蹤 1 處。結束追蹤可空出名額，原時間軸及 PDF 仍可查看。" = "The local free allowance supports tracking 1 wound. Ending tracking frees a slot. The original timeline and PDF remain available.";
"怎麼停止研究上傳或撤回？" = "How do I stop research uploads or withdraw?";
"設定 → 研究上傳／資料與撤回" = "Settings → Research uploads / Data and withdrawal";
"關閉研究上傳可停止未來送件。若要撤回已送資料，請到「資料與撤回」閱讀範圍，確認後查看進度。手機上的紀錄仍保留。" = "Turning off research uploads stops future submissions. To withdraw data already submitted, open “Data and withdrawal”, read the scope, confirm and check progress. Records on your phone are retained.";
"如何核對今天剩餘的辨識次數？" = "How do I check today’s remaining recognitions?";
"設定 → 查看個人帳號今日額度" = "Settings → View today's personal account quota";
"登入後查看服務回覆的餘額。每日成功辨識免費 2 次、Plus 共 10 次，由同帳戶所有傷口合計。在手機上保存或匯出 PDF 不會扣次。" = "After signing in, check the balance returned by the service. Free accounts have 2 successful recognitions per day; Plus has a total of 10, shared across all wounds in the account. Saving on your phone or exporting a PDF uses no recognitions.";
"在哪裡看月費或恢復購買？" = "Where can I see the price or restore purchases?";
"設定 → 服務登入、訂閱與刪帳" = "Settings → Sign-in, subscriptions and account deletion";
"開「Plus 方案與價格」先看 Apple 顯示的月費，按「登入並繼續訂閱 Plus」，依提示完成裝置核對與 Apple 登入。登入不會付款；確認價格後，再按含月費的訂閱按鈕並在 Apple 確認。已有訂閱請登入原服務帳號，再按「恢復購買」，不必再次購買。若連線或服務尚未就緒，請依畫面提示稍後重試。" = "Open “Plus plan and price” to see the monthly price from Apple. Select “Sign in and continue to Plus”, then follow the device verification and Apple sign-in prompts. Signing in does not charge you. Check the price, then select the subscription button showing the monthly price and confirm with Apple. If you already subscribe, sign in to the original service account and select “Restore purchases”; do not purchase again. If the connection or service is not ready, follow the message and retry later.";
"怎麼取消續訂或申請退款？" = "How do I cancel renewal or request a refund?";
"iPhone 或 iPad 的設定 → 您的姓名 → 訂閱" = "iPhone or iPad Settings → Your name → Subscriptions";
"也可在 WoundAILite 的設定點「管理 Apple 訂閱」，使用當初購買的 Apple 帳號選擇 WoundAILite Plus，查看續訂日期或取消續訂。申請退款請使用 Apple 帳單支援。" = "You can also select “Manage Apple subscriptions” in WoundAILite settings. Use the Apple Account that made the purchase, select WoundAILite Plus, then check the renewal date or cancel renewal. Use Apple billing support to request a refund.";
"如何刪除服務帳號？" = "How do I delete my service account?";
"設定 → 服務登入、訂閱與刪帳 → 服務帳號與刪除" = "Settings → Sign-in, subscriptions and account deletion → Service account and deletion";
"刪帳會一併要求撤回可對應的研究資料，請先閱讀畫面並核對處理進度。Apple 續訂需另外到系統的訂閱設定管理。" = "Account deletion also requests withdrawal of research data that can be linked to the account. Read the explanation and check progress. Manage Apple renewal separately in the system subscription settings.";
