"外測問題可從 TestFlight 回報 App 版本與畫面提示。資料撤回問題請到「設定 → 資料與撤回 → 聯絡資料處理支援」。請勿傳送照片、身分資料或密碼。" = "For beta issues, use TestFlight to report the App version and on-screen message. For data withdrawal, go to Settings → Data and withdrawal → Contact data handling support. Do not send photos, identifying information or passwords.";
"說明對應 WoundAILite %@。搜尋只在本機進行，App 不儲存搜尋紀錄。AI 只建議本版說明，不判讀傷口。" = "Instructions for WoundAILite %@. Search runs on this device; the App does not save search history. AI only suggests these instructions and does not assess wounds.";
